                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各位老师：</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">接教育局通知，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为积极推进我市教育信息化建设进程，充分激发教育信息化实践研究的活力与创新力，进一步加强研究成果的交流与推广和成果转化，决定组织开展省级及市级教育技术（信息化）课题研究成果鉴定活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px">所有</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">材料</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px">于</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px">2025<span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日前送达，逾期不候。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">一、</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课题成果要求</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课题成果来源省级及市级教育信息化课题（包括重点、专项、教育装备与实验教学单列课题和认定性课题）。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（二）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课题结题时间</span>2024<span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（三）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课题成果类型研究报告、科研论文（已发表）、专著（已出版）、被决策和管理部门采用的咨询报告。其中著作、科研论文和咨询报告应是单项申报。如课题成果含多种形式，请选择一种类型申报，丛书和系列论文不在申报范围内。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（四）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">有下列情况之一者，不予受理：</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">1. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">科研成果为一本专著中的部分章节或一套同名多卷（册）本著作中的部分卷（册）。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">2. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">申报人不是成果的主要拥有者（以是否第一署名、是否课题负责人等方式认定）或成果归属有争议的。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">3. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">教材类研究成果。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:7px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">4. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">已取得市级以上各类教育科学研究（包括但不限于教科规划、教研、师训等）优秀成果奖及市级以上人民政府的各项成果奖等的。</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">二、</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">材料报送要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（一共</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份材料）</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成果评审表（详见附件</span>1<span style="font-family:宋体">，纸质稿、</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">Word</span><span style="font-family:宋体">稿各</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份）</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（二）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">主报告或出版物（纸质稿</span>3<span style="font-family:宋体">份，</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">Word</span><span style="font-family:宋体">稿</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份）</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">主报告应包括研究针对的问题、研究方法和路径及研究成效，字数控制在</span>2<span style="font-family:宋体">万字以内（含目录和参考文献）。以论文、专著和咨询报告申报的可以不提交主报告；专著和论文必须是已出版或已发表，并在出版物中有注明课题名称和编号的标识。论文一般为已经在公开刊物发表的文章，只能选择一篇作为主要成果申报，字数不少于</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字，可以提交复印件，但需包括封面、目录页、全文和封底，且在醒目处盖上学校单位的公章。外文论文需附翻译件。专著是已经正式出版的课题成果，申报人需提交专著简介（不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">800</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字），书稿单独提交，由于原件不退还，提交材料必须有一本原件，其余可以是书稿复印件。咨询报告需提供由批示或采用单位提供的证明。研究报告、论文、专著简介和咨询报告均需提供电子版。可以提供与成果高相关度的佐证材料作为附件，但为非必须性材料，附件不得超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">50</span><span style="font-family:宋体">页且无需提交电子稿。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（三）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">活页评审表（详见附件</span>2<span style="font-family:宋体">，纸质稿、</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">Word</span><span style="font-family:宋体">稿各</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份）</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">填写活页评审表不能出现有关地区、有关学校、个人等提示性文字或图片信息，确需出现的一律改为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“××”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">地区，</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“××”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">学校或</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“×××”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，违反申报规定将取消参评资格；评奖工作结束后，所有申报（包含原件）材料概不退还。活页内容字数不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字，图片不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">张。需提交学术不端的检测（去除个人发表复制比不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span><span style="font-family:宋体">％）证明，并将证明的</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">PDF</span><span style="font-family:宋体">文件或者复印扫描件电子版复制粘贴在活页评审表内容的最后一页，且隐去姓名、学校等敏感信息。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（四）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成果汇总表（详见附件</span>3<span style="font-family:宋体">，纸质稿、</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">Word</span><span style="font-family:宋体">稿各</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份）</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（五）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">若有其他课题重要事项变更，则需递交课题重要事项变更申请审批表（纸质稿、</span>Word<span style="font-family:宋体">稿各</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份）</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（六）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每个上报成果独立一个文件夹，以</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">序号</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:宋体">学校名</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">命名，如</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“01</span><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴市第一中学</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。该成果的活页评审表和主报告放置在此文件夹中。如成果是以论文或专著申报的，请以</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">PDF</span><span style="font-family:宋体">格式提供，并放置在此文件夹中。纸质稿上均需盖单位公章。</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各区县按课题类别汇总后统一上报，文件夹序号需与成果汇总表（附件</span>3<span style="font-family:宋体">）中的序号相对应，市直学校以校为单位上报，不接受个人单独报送。</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">三、</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">其他事项</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">未按以上要求递交的均为无效，不进入评审。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（二）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">变更申请。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">申报人（含成员）信息应与课题组成员（结题申报表）一致，原则上不能更改和替换，以免引起不必要的麻烦和漏洞。如确需更换个别人员（非主要人员），先提交</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴市教育信息化研究课题重要事项变更申请审批表</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">电子表及盖章件，经区县审核盖章后提交市教技中心备案。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（三）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成果报送注意事项。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以科研论文作为成果报送的，须是在公开刊物上发表的，成果申报人是第一作者，且发表时间要晚于课题立项时间；以著作作为成果报送的，须是正式出版的，成果申报人是第一著者，且出版时间要晚于课题立项时间。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（四）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">集体成</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">果</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">申报人要求。集</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体成果的申报人数最多限</span>6<span style="font-family:宋体">人，即：课题负责人</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">名，课题组成员不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">名。若有执笔，仅限</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">名，需在评审表和汇总表中均括号注明。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（五）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课题管理要求等。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课题的结题申请、变更、延期、撤项均由课题负责人自愿发起。由于超过研究时间等原因未能及时结题的，由课题管理部门根据省市教育技术（信息化）研究课题管理办法直接撤项处理（详见附件</span>5<span style="font-family:宋体">）。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（六）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">联系人及联系方式</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：杨扬，电话：</span>13515755160<span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"> </span></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">附件：</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">1. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成果评审表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"> </span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/5/202505131524551661.doc" title="202505131524551661.doc" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202505131524551661.doc</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">2. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">活页评审表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"> </span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/5/202505131525170538.doc" title="202505131525170538.doc" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202505131525170538.doc</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">3. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成果汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"> </span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_xls.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/5/202505131525281423.xls" title="202505131525281423.xls" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202505131525281423.xls</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">4. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">结题相关材料</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"> </span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/5/202505131525404808.rar" title="202505131525404808.rar" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202505131525404808.rar</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">5. </span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">省市教育技术（信息化）研究课题管理办法</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/5/202505131525555719.rar" title="202505131525555719.rar">202505131525555719.rar</a></p><p>
</p>
    
